1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,800
Today we are going to get stuck and then we are going to learn a trick.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Let us try three plus three.

3
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:10,140
First make three.

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:13,800
Push three lower beads up on the ones rod.

5
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,820
Now we want to add three more.

6
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,000
So push one more bead up and another one.

7
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:23,320
And now we are stuck.

8
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,860
There is no bead left to push.

9
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:27,460
Count them.

10
00:00:28,140 --> 00:00:31,660
One, two, three, four.

11
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:35,240
Four is all the lower beads a rod has.

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,180
So we cannot add three the easy way.

13
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,520
But look up here.

14
00:00:41,140 --> 00:00:43,340
The upper bead has not moved at all.

15
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,000
And the upper bead is worth five.

16
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,700
Five is bigger than three.

17
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,880
So we have more than enough.

18
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:53,600
We just have to use it cleverly.

19
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,320
Here is the clever part.

20
00:00:56,980 --> 00:00:59,120
Every small number has a friend.

21
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,240
Two friends that make five together.

22
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:04,520
One and four are friends.

23
00:01:05,560 --> 00:01:06,940
Two and three are friends.

24
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,620
Say them with me.

25
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:10,280
One and four.

26
00:01:11,220 --> 00:01:12,220
Two and three.

27
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,980
These are called the small friends.

28
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:17,780
Now watch what the friends do.

29
00:01:18,860 --> 00:01:20,280
We wanted to add three.

30
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,500
Three's friend is two.

31
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:27,220
So instead of adding three we add five and take away two.

32
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:30,440
Because five take away two is three.

33
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:34,300
It is the same answer the easy way round.

34
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,240
Let us do it.

35
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:38,080
Our rod is showing three.

36
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:41,620
Remember lower beads move first.

37
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:44,020
So take away two lower beads.

38
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:46,760
Now the rod shows one.

39
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:50,200
Then push the upper bead down for five.

40
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:53,160
And now the rod shows six.

41
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:55,660
Three plus three is six.

42
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:59,000
We did it and we never ran out of beads.

43
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:02,580
Let us try four plus three.

44
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:05,080
First make four.

45
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:07,940
Push all four lower beads up.

46
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:10,380
Now add three.

47
00:02:10,380 --> 00:02:12,800
Three's friend is two again.

48
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,340
So take away two lower beads.

49
00:02:16,380 --> 00:02:17,580
The rod shows two.

50
00:02:18,490 --> 00:02:20,340
Then push the upper bead down.

51
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:22,740
The rod shows seven.

52
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:25,500
Four plus three is seven.

53
00:02:26,980 --> 00:02:28,560
Now it is your turn.

54
00:02:29,580 --> 00:02:31,540
Make two on your own abacus.

55
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:32,900
Then add four.

56
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:35,180
Four's friend is one.

57
00:02:36,040 --> 00:02:39,060
So take away one and push the upper bead down.

58
00:02:40,260 --> 00:02:42,020
What number is showing now?

59
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,800
Two plus four is six.

60
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,360
Well done.

61
00:02:48,380 --> 00:02:50,700
That is your first abacus formula.

62
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:56,160
There is one for every small number and we will learn them all.

63
00:02:57,280 --> 00:03:01,360
If you enjoyed this video please like and subscribe for more.

64
00:03:02,340 --> 00:03:06,240
Search for abacus kids on the Apple App Store or Google Play.

65
00:03:07,060 --> 00:03:07,920
Download it free.

66
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:12,760
Next time we will learn all four small friends for adding.

67
00:03:13,620 --> 00:03:14,840
See you next time.
